# Telegram bot — form lead notifications
# 1. Create a bot with @BotFather → paste the token below
# 2. Write /start to the bot (any staff who should get leads)
# 3. Optional production: set webhook so new subscribers are stored immediately:
#    https://api.telegram.org/bot<TOKEN>/setWebhook?url=https://YOUR_DOMAIN/api/telegram/webhook
#
# Notes:
# - TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID is not used. Everyone who messaged the bot receives leads.
# - Chat ids are stored in data/telegram-subscribers.json after /start.

TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
